Diff summary:
* Added SV3 to the existing surface harness, covering sender-only control results, frame fan-out, and unknown-event result fan-out.
* Recorded control-event senders before dispatch; routed matching results once to their sender, removed entries on result or session loss, and retained lit-face fan-out for unknown event IDs. Preserved the existing per-session fan-out work.

Exact test name:
* surface traffic reaches each session over its own port > SV3 — a control result answers its sender alone

Verification:
* <code>pnpm &#45;-filter &#64;lararium/web exec tsc &#45;-noEmit -p .</code> passed.
* Browser checks: lead runs. SV3 was written before the host change; browser-mode red/green execution was not run in this seat.

